## Lifecycle Phases

### 1. Discovery ← **YOU ARE HERE**
- [ ] PRD completed (`docs/product/PRD.md`)
- [ ] Problem statement validated
- [ ] Target users defined with personas
- [ ] Core user flows mapped (minimum 3)
- [ ] MVP scope defined (in-scope AND out-of-scope)
- [ ] Competitive research completed
- [ ] Success metrics defined

**Gate:** Run phase-gate agent to validate → Spec phase

### 2. Specification
- [ ] Feature specs created for all MVP features (`docs/specs/`)
- [ ] User stories with acceptance criteria
- [ ] Data model designed
- [ ] API endpoints designed
- [ ] Edge cases documented
- [ ] Test plans written

**Gate:** Run phase-gate agent to validate → Architecture phase

### 3. Architecture
- [ ] ADRs for key tech decisions (`docs/adr/`)
- [ ] Database schema finalized
- [ ] API contracts defined
- [ ] Component architecture designed
- [ ] Implementation plans created (`docs/plans/`)
{{#ifMultiTenancy config}}
- [ ] Multi-tenancy strategy validated
{{/ifMultiTenancy}}
{{#if config.design.figmaFileKey}}
- [ ] Figma designs completed and linked
{{/if}}
- [ ] Infrastructure plan documented

**Gate:** Run phase-gate agent to validate → Development phase

### 4. Development
- [ ] Core infrastructure set up (DB, auth, CI/CD)
- [ ] Feature implementation in progress
- [ ] Tests written alongside code
- [ ] Code reviews via `/self-review`
{{#if config.hasFrontend}}
- [ ] Design review via `/design-review`
{{/if}}

**Gate:** Run phase-gate agent to validate → Review phase

### 5. Review & QA
- [ ] All acceptance criteria met
- [ ] Test suite passing (unit + integration + e2e)
- [ ] Security audit passed
- [ ] Performance benchmarks met
- [ ] Documentation up to date
- [ ] `/sync-docs` run with no drift detected

**Gate:** Run phase-gate agent to validate → Deploy phase

### 6. Deployment
- [ ] Staging deployment successful
- [ ] Production deployment
- [ ] Monitoring configured
- [ ] Runbook documented

